ry for my weakness in English again thank you RTM thank you @IF","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1341","p":54,"im":["1be26c66dbbc7694059716866c6de3bb5b34074d"],"m":1341},{"id":"dbrrbd_p54_1342","t":"HERE HI AGAIN\n\ni want to talk about reaction an rejection of bases. i think if one kind of these (RBD,DBR,RBR,DBD) engulf an other one may be make us a reaction but in future that reaction will be reject.\n\nthis is how i read the chart. these are some DPs. we look for engulf of one and then after the reaction wait for reject it.\n\nlook num1 that react by num2 (the reaction make an engulf for us ) and after that rejected by new DP(RBD3) to an other BASE as a target.\n\nANY COMMENTS ARE WELCOME.","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1342","p":54,"im":["7772d88a26cef081b90c5c28c266233ed8d8980f"],"m":1342},{"id":"dbrrbd_p54_1343","t":"An other hi with an other homework","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1343","p":54,"im":["fd412e0a9d36155c5e33e542a6c23e5c2dd03430"],"m":1343},{"id":"dbrrbd_p54_1344","t":"THIS TIME USD/JPY HOMEWORK\n\ncomments/suggestions are really appreciated.","a":"salivan","d":"","n":"#1344","p":54,"im":["2a2500deb37b93ca5d3ea19635ec1d971f3ac7ca"],"m":1344},{"id":"dbrrbd_p54_1345","t":"Comments are most welcome\n\nProblem with uploading jpg. So, here is the tpl. AUDUSD H1; from 2015.11.27 04:00 to 2016.04.21 02:00","a":"Ahmadhassan745","d":"","n":"#1345","p":54,"im":[],"m":1345},{"id":"dbrrbd_p54_1346","t":"Problem Resolved. So, here are the Pics.\n\nComments are Most Welcome; I will be happy to read the comments","a":"Ahmadhassan745","d":"","n":"#1346","p":54,"im":["e23191cff7c7954973100b0363929f4e4415e708","a3b52ef0aa50eee8fb4a91dda3eb189c7c52464f","7fc2b95ea89d75118d3b17e6a8abc04f9a2819c4","8de12c92ced68c9a998fff26ab16eaf74c075375","18d06c9d1e0562c853e2762c34b115afcc32beb3","9eb02499bed94ee7680869a18254494a58cfb360","2d2ceccd993d73facf32ae881c88f8d27928b7a7","127da771f50dce4aeae3cdadea98ce138aabc15a","a8319799fbf952c40c56ad79e346177de268ed5b"],"m":1346},{"id":"dbrrbd_p54